type: software
title: 'Attaclone-dedup: Detecting and managing duplicate file attachments in Zotero'
abstract: A Zotero 9+ plugin that detects duplicate file attachments within items by content hash, auto-resolves
  byte-identical bare copies, and provides a manual review dialog (with optional annotation merging) for
  ambiguous cases.
